  "id": "no-treatment-control-group",
  "term": "no-treatment control group",
  "definition": "A no-treatment control group is a comparison group in a study whose members do not receive the treatment being tested. It is used to show whether outcomes in treated participants differ from what happens when no intervention is given.",
